  "source": "* Up to five pieces can be acquired from an Alluring Specimen, but with each harvest there is a chance for an Abyssal Horror to appear, destroying the remaining cores. \n* Can be found in Derelict Freighter containers.\n* Can be found in the form of Submerged Relics (one piece).\n* From Suspicious Packet (Goods).\n* From Nexus and Mission Board Missions.\n* As a gift from Planetary Settlement visitors.",
