  "page": "NipNip Buds",
  "source": "The primary source is harvesting.\n*Can be purchased in outlaw systems.\n*Can be occasionally bought from Scrap Dealers on space stations. \n*Can be found in Derelict Freighter containers.\n*Can occasionally be given as a reward for Nexus missions.\n*Can occasionally be purchased on planets from black market traders for nanites.\n*Can occasionally be purchased on planets from landed ships.\n*It is a possible reward from frigate expeditions.",
